<node id="Cupiagua">
  <data key="d0">Cupiagua</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Cupiagua is a locality situated in Aguazul, in the department of Casanare, Colombia. It serves as a critical site for the Detailed Engineering Project for Strategic Conditioning, formally known as "Proyecto Acondicionamiento Estratégico de Cupiagua." This project focuses on various engineering aspects and material requisitions, particularly those related to mechanical and chemical specialties. Within this framework, Cupiagua is recognized as a strategic location for installing vital components such as hydraulic and chemical injection packages, highlighting its importance in the execution of the project that encompasses both engineering specifics and strategic conditioning considerations.

In addition to its geographical significance, Cupiagua is also associated with essential technical specifications for the chemical injection package. This locality appears prominently in project documentation concerning engineering requisitions, indicating that it may encompass not just a physical place but potentially also a company or organizational reference linked to the engineering initiatives underway. Moreover, Cupiagua is noted for its role in the Piedemonte operational area, located approximately 175 kilometers northeast of Bogotá, Colombia.

Notably, Cupiagua is identified as the contractor responsible for the numerous technical specifications related to the project. This includes oversight of engineering details, supply, and operation of the Paquete de Inyección de Químicos, involving gas compression equipment as well. The locality is repeatedly referenced in the context of project documentation, demonstrating its integral role as the contractor managing the engineering and conditioning details for the ongoing endeavors associated with the project. 

Overall, Cupiagua stands out as a pivotal entity within the broader landscape of strategic engineering developments in the region, reflecting its multifaceted importance as both a geographical location and a contracting entity involved in key operational aspects of engineering projects.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7375bf85874c49ad2409b8d3782f200c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b25365fe27b2d7e2bfae49b4d39e29e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2c5e20947e8fb244a510847cbb87a9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f7bd8ed9046cc98ab1bcc0c47cc0dd5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb69d0b355642374bf610d72bdd2be67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3abd7a72b8499246b791f4538eb108c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c662844e5f53028fea2a197d76e83f79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d6479332bfd937b730880ede28d7d948&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df5c67a0f957af4d718ba59d9f4390e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef5864c8accd616701328ef00d004ac9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b1634e254b06d07128011227d8d7198&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-506e108a9d6a630f71bb55a27c0d5044&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57d726f33417979c7147e16c69b48efc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3e68c9d5ad611737366bcd55e89cae3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef5c1b5733c5c77732c8127157466aa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db3a9e5bda9057182f8d98e01e2aa1e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6d681dcefdf48e0eaee20190a6701c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53c7e80edcbbac50f89b51bd3620e16b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f13b310f72ab3ce2e0957b6c425a495a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9e0c997e88258ee8389f9c3cb06aba7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16597b25c71f737c9daa4a9aa0cee115&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0797ccf665ea0ae514c36f9760d4584b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f97d6127043779a31bab8eac8bb0152a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf47a03b531d951079ffe72edc045234&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cdef129bd8b8fffc28ca356f70386ca</data>
