  <data key="d1">document</data>
  <data key="d2">Requisición de Materiales is a requisition document contained within MR Paquete de Inyección de Químicos that specifies the materials needed for the project.&lt;SEP&gt;Requisición de Materiales is the title of a document specifying requirements and procedures for procurement.&lt;SEP&gt;Requisición de Materiales is a document that outlines the material requisition process for the package.&lt;SEP&gt;Requisición de Materiales is a document outlining the material requirements and specifications for the project.&lt;SEP&gt;Requisición de Materiales is a document pertaining to the request for materials in mechanical specialization, dated 01-11-2023.</data>
