<node id="VENDEDOR">
  <data key="d0">VENDEDOR</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">VENDEDOR refers to the seller responsible for supplying and installing the chemical injection package in accordance with specified standards.&lt;SEP&gt;The VENDEDOR is the seller responsible for supplying the equipment and ensuring compliance with the technical specifications.&lt;SEP&gt;VENDEDOR is the seller responsible for delivering diagrams, wiring information, and various electrical components as part of the package.&lt;SEP&gt;VENDEDOR refers to the vendor responsible for supplying the products and verifying the specifications.&lt;SEP&gt;VENDEDOR refers to the vendor responsible for supplying safety valves, pressure indicators, and other necessary accessories in the DCS system.&lt;SEP&gt;The VENDEDOR is responsible for providing training, spare parts, and technical specifications for the installation and commissioning of the PAQUETE.&lt;SEP&gt;VENDEDOR refers to a seller obligated to comply with contract requirements and documentation protocols.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-506e108a9d6a630f71bb55a27c0d5044&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3e68c9d5ad611737366bcd55e89cae3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c710b6a6fa93867765a00a95a0590465&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db3a9e5bda9057182f8d98e01e2aa1e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16597b25c71f737c9daa4a9aa0cee115&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c5ef2486f61a18cd268f8230bc3ad7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fe341253aae72bd54524a9dd78eab4f</data>
