<node id="PAQUETE">
  <data key="d0">PAQUETE</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">PAQUETE refers to the integrated chemical injection package designed for automatic operation in a specific process.&lt;SEP&gt;PAQUETE refers to a package of electrical equipment and components that needs to be delivered fully installed, wired, connected, and tested.&lt;SEP&gt;PAQUETE refers to the package that includes switches and components necessary for controlling pumps.&lt;SEP&gt;The PAQUETE refers to the system or package being supplied and commissioned, which includes equipment and components requiring proper handling and shipping.&lt;SEP&gt;PAQUETE represents the Chemical Injection Package being reviewed, which includes various engineering details and specifications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-506e108a9d6a630f71bb55a27c0d5044&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57d726f33417979c7147e16c69b48efc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db3a9e5bda9057182f8d98e01e2aa1e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16597b25c71f737c9daa4a9aa0cee115&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c5ef2486f61a18cd268f8230bc3ad7e</data>
